## Managed hosting, zero headaches

We take care of everything — server setup, security, backups, and performance. You just focus on your business. No dealing with hosting companies, no confusing control panels, no unexpected downtime.

Your site loads fast, stays online, and is protected from threats. If anything goes wrong, we fix it.

## Why hosting matters for Google rankings

Page speed is a direct ranking factor. A slow host hurts your [Google rankings](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/) — which means fewer visitors, fewer enquiries, and fewer customers. Our hosting uses Cloudflare's global CDN to make your site fast for visitors anywhere in the UK.

## Pair hosting with the right services

Good hosting is the foundation. Stack it with [monthly maintenance](/services/website-maintenance-packages/) to keep your site updated and secure over time. And if you need a new site to host, our [web design service](/services/web-design/) delivers a fast, modern site built to perform from day one.

We host websites for businesses across [Cardiff](/web-design-cardiff/), [Swansea](/web-design-swansea/), [Merthyr Tydfil](/web-design-merthyr-tydfil/), [Newport](/web-design-newport/), and all of [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/).
